type: software
title: "DATA 200: Python Learning Log"
abstract: >-
  Course materials for DATA 200: Introduction to Data Science at James Madison
  University. A semester-long Python learning log: at least four entries a week,
  each with its own Python file, the complete code in a LaTeX report, a screenshot
  of a successful run, and a reflection; with a report template and four
  fictional sample entries.
